            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>After the publication of this work [1] it was noticed that on page 3 of the article beginning in the paragraph-'Hydrazide 14 is used as a key producer…' the compound-&quot;Not ethyl-N'-5-amino-1,3-diphenyl-1H-thieno[3,2-c]pyrazole-6-carbonylformohydrazonate&quot; should be deleted. Also on page 10 of the PDF beginning in paragraph-'Synthesis of 5-amino-…' the compound-&quot;Not ethyl-N'-5-amino-1,3-diphenyl-1H-thieno[3,2-c]pyrazole-6-carbonylformohydrazonate&quot; should be deleted. We apologise for these errors.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
